# /sdd Command Specification
Purpose:
  /sdd Command Specification


Command: /sdd "prompt"
Alias: /sdd-run

Description:
  Execute SDDRA chain graph from prompts in the prompts/ folder.
  Claude reads prompts/, selects next prompt, reads .sdd/, generates docs,
  waits for approval, generates .sdd/project/, waits for approval, generates code.

Usage:
  /sdd "prompt-001"
  /sdd "prompt-001/prompt.md"
  /sdd "inbox/prompt-003"
  /sdd --list
  /sdd --status

Behavior:
  1. Read prompts/ folder
  2. Find next prompt to process (inbox or active)
  3. Read prompt.md
  4. Read first skill from prompt/skill/
  5. Read .sdd/PROJECT.sdd
  6. Read .sdd/chains/graph.sdd
  7. Select chain: D0 -> D1 -> S1 -> C1
  8. Execute D1 (docs arm):
       - Generate docs/ from prompt
       - Create decision records (DEC-XXX)
       - Record tokens
       - Return to D0
  9. Wait for human approval (Gate P1->D1)
  10. Execute S1 (sdd arm):
        - Convert docs/ to .sdd/project/
        - Create tasks linked to decisions
        - Record tokens
        - Return to D0
  11. Wait for human approval (Gate D1->S1)
  12. Execute C1 (code arm):
        - Execute tasks from .sdd/project/
        - Update decision status
        - Record tokens
        - Return to D0
  13. Wait for human review (Gate S1->C1)
  14. Execute R1 (review arm):
        - Present code for review
        - Record tokens
        - Return to D0
  15. Wait for human approval (Gate C1->R1)
  16. Execute DEP1 (deploy arm):
        - Deploy to production
        - Record tokens
        - Return to D0
  17. Move prompt to archive
  18. Complete

Token Budget: 70,000 total

Output Format:
  [tokens: in=X, out=Y, delta=Z]
  [decision: DEC-XXX]
  [gate: human_required|auto]
  [next: D0->D1|D0->S1|...]
  [status: completed|pending|failed]
  [prompt: prompt-XXX]

Prompt Selection:
  Priority order:
    1. active/ (currently being worked on)
    2. inbox/ (new prompts)
    3. prompt-XXX/ (numbered prompts)

  Selection criteria:
    - Oldest first (FIFO)
    - Dependencies resolved
    - Resources available

Prompt State:
  inbox -> active -> archive
  inbox: New prompts awaiting processing
  active: Prompts currently being worked on
  archive: Completed prompts

Prompt Folder Structure:
  prompts/
    prompt-XXX/
      prompt.md          â€” Original user prompt
      skill/             â€” First skill to execute
        SKILL.sdd
      context/           â€” Execution context
        decisions/
        tasks/
        docs/
      state/             â€” Current execution state
      logs/              â€” Execution logs

State: +

